<title>UK: OPEC basket price fell to $22.84 last week.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price fell to $22.84 last week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of OPEC's basket of seven crudes fell to $22.84 per barrel last week from $23.84 the previous week, the OPEC news agency OPECNA said on Monday.</p>
<p>Quoting figures released by the OPEC Secretariat, it said the price so far this year has averaged $19.75.</p>
<p>In September it averaged $21.68, against $19.94 in August and $19.29 in July.</p>
<p>In the third quarter of 1996 it averaged $20.22, against $19.26 in the second.</p>
<p>The basket comprises Algeria's Saharan Blend, Indonesia's Minas, Nigeria's Bonny Light, Saudi Arabia's Arabian Light, Dubai of the UAE, Venezuela's Tia Juana and Mexico's Isthmus.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7630</p>
